+.. versionadded:: TBD
+
+The optional *contact_distance_factor* sets the finite positive factor
+:math:`f_c`, whose default is 1.35. A value of 1.0 starts repulsion below
+one lattice spacing. It changes neither the contact stiffness nor any
+bond coefficient. The pair cutoff still limits the neighbor range, so
+choose the onset within that range. This option is an engineering model
+choice, not a measured material contact radius.
+
